-- (round 85) SWING TIME: a top hat and cane Charleston, 32 beats on the
-- groove of "Swing With Me (Electro Swing Mix)" (APM, 130 bpm), under a
-- spotlight. The hat and cane pop in for a ta-da (1-2), a shimmy each way
-- (3-4), the Charleston twice - step, kick forward, step back, kick back,
-- toes swiveling (5-12) - the bee's knees on the swung eighths, hands
-- together over his knees (13-16), the cane twirled out at his side on a
-- step-touch (17-20), Charleston kicks with the cane up over his head
-- (21-24), leaning on it and tapping it on the beat (25-28), a spin (29),
-- coiled up passing the cane to his other hand and a hand to the brim on
-- the "and" (30) - and the hat tip: swept off and out in a bow (31-32).
